# osal/test/mpp_runtime_test.c passes the wrong function type to
# pthread_create. GCC 14 turned that class of warning into an error, so the
# tree no longer builds on resolute; it was written against bookworm's GCC 12,
# and the PPAs that packaged it never went past noble's GCC 13, so there is no
# prior art to copy here.
#
# Suppressed rather than fixed because the file is a test binary that no
# shipped package contains. A real fix belongs upstream in the mirror, which
# we own -- at which point this file goes away.
DEB_CFLAGS_MAINT_APPEND=-Wno-error=incompatible-pointer-types -Wno-error=implicit-function-declaration
